scn 1
# Passing within a small click (2026-11-16; tools/legion_overtake_test.py): the point just past a gate,
# 12 mid 2x2 bodies (1.9), 12 slow 2x2 ones (1.15) and 12 fast 3x3 ones (2.9) at the rear, in rows 60 cells wide,
# one right-click about 990 px through a 12-cell gap in a wall to a point 10 cells past it. Asset-free.
name overtake-click-gate
ticks 6000
players 1
weapons off
map flat 160 220
type slow mover 2 2500 1 1.15
type mid mover 2 2500 1 1.9
type fast mover 3 2500 1 2.9
wall 0 110 74 4
wall 86 110 74 4
group M1 0 mid 12 rect 50 150 110 156 pitch=5
group S1 0 slow 12 rect 50 158 110 164 pitch=5
group F1 0 fast 12 rect 50 166 110 174 pitch=5
at 5 move M1,S1,F1 80 100
